# Edit backups. Same lesson as voiceprint.json.bak two lines up: a `.pre-<something>`
# copy of a file is as sensitive as the file, and `.env` only ever matched `.env`
# exactly before `.env.*` was added. These are a rollback path, not a deliverable.
*.pre-*
